  "markdown": "top of page\n\nSkip to Main Content\n\n## WHAT WE DO\n\n[![icon2.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_9e430fd685274afab18fed12143420c6~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_179,h_79,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/icon2.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/meetings)\n\n#### [FULL MEETING & EVENT MANAGEMENT](https://www.reachmeetings.com/meetings)\n\nOur team includes seasoned event planners that can conceive, create, design, and deliver events to your highest level of satisfaction.\n\n[![icon5.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_5c2e3436acad4a8abbcb613554944c70~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_179,h_79,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/icon5.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/venue-sourcing)\n\n#### [VENUE SOURCING](https://www.reachmeetings.com/venue-sourcing)\n\nWe provide expert site knowledge and contract negotiation at no cost to our clients. Venue Sourcing involves the detailed process of gathering and analyzing available venue options for your upcoming meeting or event.\n\n[![icon6.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_eba349fddd504c2db1ba9ca8c63199f9~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_139,h_59,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/icon6.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/incentive-programs)\n\n#### [INCENTIVE PROGRAMS](https://www.reachmeetings.com/incentive-programs)\n\nOur team includes celebrated leaders in the Incentive Travel industry.  We plan customized incentive trips to make them compelling and extremely rewarding to the participants.\n\n[![icon7.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_8c66cb53817e41f1a721c4e4600c6db1~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_139,h_59,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/icon7.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/event-staffing)\n\n#### [EVENT STAFFING](https://www.reachmeetings.com/event-staffing)\n\nOutsourced onsite teams should always be an extension of your staff.\n\n[![thumbnail_image_edited.jpg](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_0b80e7f21d2e436ea11429521a9e2983~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_84,h_64,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/thumbnail_image_edited.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/life-science-meetings)\n\n#### [LIFE SCIENCE\\ \\ MEETINGS](https://www.reachmeetings.com/life-science-meetings)\n\nStrengthen talent, standardize methodologies, increase confidence, accomplish goals, achieve a higher level of work.\n\n[![icon1.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_4c8641663a5b466897778ed8d06da45a~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_343,y_0,w_557,h_529/fill/w_70,h_64,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/icon1.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/executive-retreats)\n\n#### [EXECUTIVE RETREATS](https://www.reachmeetings.com/executive-retreats)\n\nLeveraging over 20 years of C-suite consulting experience, we understand the importance of executive interactions.  We consult with our clients to design and deliver the most productive and enjoyable executive retreats imaginable.​\n\n[![Unknown-64.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_2cdaddf89172460b8702546a5ed59e77~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_154,h_68,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Unknown-64.png)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/investor-meetings)\n\n#### [INVESTOR MEETINGS](https://www.reachmeetings.com/investor-meetings)\n\nOur expertise is incomparable as the trusted planner for many of the world's foremost companies, for a myriad of meeting types.\n\n![airplane icon for website.jfif](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_7caf6b0ddd0c422db2ab7a0c76db8942~mv2.jpg/v1/crop/x_231,y_238,w_514,h_496/fill/w_62,h_59,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/airplane%20icon%20for%20website_jfif.jpg)\n\n#### FULL SERVICE TRAVEL AGENCY\n\nWhite glove leisure and corporate travel services with affiliations to major hotel operators, global airlines, Disney, and cruise operators.​\n\n![Bells_edited.png](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_8f9ea7fbd1ce409a9da79fbe2dc132b0~mv2.png/v1/crop/x_0,y_65,w_997,h_691/fill/w_107,h_74,al_c,q_85,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Bells_edited.png)\n\n#### [WEDDING & SOCIAL VENUE SOURCING](https://www.reachmeetings.com/wedding-hotel-block-sourcing)\n\nWe have a deep expertise in sourcing group hotel blocks. Our complimentary service analyzes and negotiates on your behalf to provide the most preferable venues to our clients.\n\n[![REACH logo](https://static.wixstatic.com/media/28cd78_b6659293240c40db888d813137f151bc~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_240,h_100,al_c,q_80,usm_0.66_1.00_0.01,enc_avif,quality_auto/Reach%20Logo%20jpg.jpg)](https://www.reachmeetings.com/)\n\nbottom of page",
